<!DOCTYPE suite SYSTEM "https://testng.org/testng-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  MASTER REGRESSION SUITE — every standalone feature suite in the framework.
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  This is a "suite of suites": it references each individual suite file via
  <suite-files>. TestNG loads every referenced suite and runs it WITH ITS OWN
  settings (its own parallel / thread-count / listeners / account setup). The
  referenced suites run one after another (sequentially), which also keeps their
  dedicated test accounts from colliding across features.

  Run (adjust profile per squad — some suites need sit-remittance):
    mvn clean test "-Dsuite=suites/regression-all.xml" "-Dprofile=sit-wmv"

  SCOPE — INCLUDED: one entry per feature (auth, settings, wallet, qatta, cards,
  payments, telecom, government, remittance).

  DELIBERATELY EXCLUDED (would double-run or clash):
    • Meta-collections that just bundle the suites below:
        all-wallet-settings.xml, payments-and-cards-collection.xml,
        remittance-collection.xml, new-suites-parallel.xml, all-cards.xml,
        telecom-recharge.xml, esim-sadad.xml, government-services.xml
    • Duplicate / method-split variants:
        forgot-passcode-default-tier-parallel.xml (dup of default-tier),
        moneygram-bankdeposit.xml + moneygram-sendtowallet.xml
        (method subsets of moneygram-transfer.xml)
    • Retest / scratch suites:  retest-fixes.xml, retest-permission.xml
    • Provisioning (setup, not tests):  provision-users.xml, provision-family-pair.xml
    • smoke.xml (quick subset of the below — run on its own for fast checks)

  NOTE: family-wallet.xml is a multi-class suite but is KEPT — it is the only
  suite covering Send Gift, Direct Top-up, Permission Control and Family Request
  Money (no standalone equivalents exist).
-->
